        "note": "built from N given values (index, value pairs) over any index range [lo, hi], every other index 0; costs are in N; wavelet matrix: one row of N + 1 prefix counts per bit of the compressed value; rangeMex uses a persistent seg tree over the values 0..N+1 holding each value's last index; OR by value: per level, a sparse table over its order (O(1) a window); AND by value: per level, a segment tree over its order (O(log N) a window); the structure is over the given values only, and the zeros of [l, r] are added in closed form (they sit between the negatives and the positives)",
